<wpt lat="38.88425" lon="-84.75214"><name>2-fer US-4572 + US-3779</name><cmt>Big Bone Lick visitor center (NPS trail site listing)</cmt><desc>US-4572 Lewis and Clark National Historic Trail + US-3779 Big Bone Lick State Historic Site. Big Bone Lick visitor center (NPS trail site listing). Set up inside the park on public land, near the trail signage or site. Listed by the NPS as a Lewis &amp; Clark trail site (visitor center). Lewis stopped here in October 1803. National Historic Trails have no boundary, so POTA looks for certified or official trail sites with signage. Do your own research before you go. Planning tool only: confirm before you go.</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
